# Live across Cursor and Claude — there is no shared chat

Cursor Cloud, Cursor Desktop, and Claude Code do **not** share a conversation.
Do not ask Elena to paste Claude transcripts. Do not pretend a Claude MCP exists.

## Every session, before money work

1. Read `docs/oracle/NOW.md` (the live queue).
2. Treat **HubSpot** as the system of record for deals, notes, and send buttons.
3. If NOW.md and HubSpot disagree, HubSpot wins — then update NOW.md and push.

## What “live” means here

| Live | Not live |
| --- | --- |
| Git (`NOW.md`, `CLAUDE.md`, this rule) | Claude Code chat |
| HubSpot deals / notes / tasks | A Cursor↔Claude MCP |
| Oracle HubSpot+Zoho scripts | Gmail MCP (needs auth) |

When you change the money queue (new send URL, new deal to tap, do-not-countersign), edit `docs/oracle/NOW.md` in the same commit.
